  "body": "Docs-only PR for #790 (part of #339): a user-guide page for bringing a vendor fixture or vise STEP into CamCraft, and the import check run on local vendor files.\n\n## What changed\n- `docs/user-guide/vendor-fixtures.md`: units and scale, orientation, marking as a fixture, placing with Locate part, saving to the library, and limits. Labels come from the app's UI sources.\n- `docs/decisions/790-vendor-step-guide.md`: the decisions taken unattended.\n\n## Import check (local inputs only, not committed)\nRun through `camcraft-cli mcp` (private build of this branch's base, upstream main e2d655e5). Vendor names and dimensions are kept out of this PR on purpose.\n\n| Input | Imports | Time | Triangles | Units | Bounds vs published drawing | Mark as fixture | detect_holes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| vendor fixture plate STEP (inch) | yes | 0.43 s | 34,044 | declared inch, scaled to mm | X and Y match the drawing; Z is 0.10 in off the drawing's stated thickness (unresolved, may be the simplified model) | works | 471 holes found; matches the drawing's published hole count |\n| vendor subplate STEP | yes | 0.65 s | 3,748 | declared inch | not compared (the vendor sheet read states no overall size) | works | 5 holes found (not compared) |\n| vendor modular vise STEP, single station | yes | 0.22 s | 4,585 | declared inch | no axis matches the drawing's overall length; the file is likely a different configuration or assembly (needs a human look) | works | 19 holes found (not compared) |\n| vendor modular vise STEP, dual station | yes | 0.21 s | 3,480 | declared inch | not compared (same drawing as above) | works | not run |\n\nBodies: the MCP reports one model per import; a body count is not exposed.\nNo importer bug was proven, so no bug issue was filed.\n\n## How tested\n- Each file imported through `camcraft-cli mcp` with `import_model`, read back with `get_job`, marked with `add_fixture`, and (plate, subplate, vise) run through `add_tool`, `add_operation` (Drill) and `detect_holes` on a non-fixture copy.\n- No code changed, so no test or gate. Docs only.\n\n## Not exercised\n- The guide's steps were checked against UI labels in the source, not clicked in the running app.\n- Built-in parametric vises (#788, PR #802) and the fixture plate grid (#819) are described as not yet available.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFork synced at v0.17.0.\n\nFixes #790\n\n",
